5,"v":{"Relationships":"All Evidences (<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?agent0=BCL2&agent1=TNF&format=html&expand_all=false\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">260</a>)<ul><li/>TNF activates BCL2(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=BCL2&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">63</a>)<li/>TNF increases the amount of BCL2(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=BCL2&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">51</a>)<li/>TNF decreases the amount of BCL2(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=BCL2&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">45</a>)<li/>TNF inhibits BCL2(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=BCL2&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">25</a>)<li/>TNF binds BCL2(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=BCL2&type=Complex&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">15</a>)<li/>TNF phosphorylates BCL2(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=BCL2&type=Phosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">4</a>)<li/>TNF dephosphorylates BCL2(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=BCL2&type=Dephosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">2</a>)<li/>BCL2 inhibits TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=BCL2&object=TNF&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">25</a>)<li/>BCL2 activates TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=BCL2&object=TNF&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">19</a>)<li/>BCL2 increases the amount of TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=BCL2&object=TNF&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">6</a>)<li/>BCL2 decreases the amount of TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=BCL2&object=TNF&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">5</a>)</ul>","__relationship_score":5.560681631015528,"i":"interacts with"}},{"id":393,"s":11,"t":23,"v":{"Relationships":"All Evidences (<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?agent0=RPS6KB1&agent1=TNF&format=html&expand_all=false\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">89</a>)<ul><li/>TNF activates RPS6KB1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=RPS6KB1&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">38</a>)<li/>TNF phosphorylates RPS6KB1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=RPS6KB1&type=Phosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">15</a>)<li/>TNF inhibits RPS6KB1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=RPS6KB1&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">9</a>)<li/>TNF binds RPS6KB1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=RPS6KB1&type=Complex&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">5</a>)<li/>TNF increases the amount of RPS6KB1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=RPS6KB1&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">5</a>)<li/>RPS6KB1 activates TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=RPS6KB1&object=TNF&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">10</a>)<li/>RPS6KB1 increases the amount of TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=RPS6KB1&object=TNF&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">4</a>)<li/>RPS6KB1 inhibits TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=RPS6KB1&object=TNF&type=Inhibi